msgid ""
"The app needs glibc {version}, newer than this system's. Update the system "
"or use an older version of the app."
msgstr ""
"Die App braucht glibc {version}, neuer als die dieses Systems. Aktualisiere "
"das System oder verwende eine ältere Version der App."

#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:394
msgid "Graphics acceleration is off"
msgstr "Grafikbeschleunigung ist aus"

#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:394
msgid "The app could not use the GPU. Turn on GPU acceleration."
msgstr ""
"Die App konnte die GPU nicht nutzen. Schalte die GPU-Beschleunigung ein."

#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:402
msgid "Graphics driver files are hidden"
msgstr "Dateien des Grafiktreibers sind verborgen"

#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:402
msgid ""
"The GPU driver could not load in SAM's minimal system view. Show all of /usr."
msgstr ""
"Der GPU-Treiber ließ sich in SAMs minimaler Systemansicht nicht laden. Zeig "
"ganz /usr."

#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:427
msgid "The app wants your keyring"
msgstr "Die App möchte deinen Schlüsselbund"

#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:427
msgid ""
"The app tried to store or read a login. Allowing the keyring lets it read "
"every password stored there."
msgstr ""
"Die App wollte eine Anmeldung speichern oder lesen. Wenn du den "
"Schlüsselbund erlaubst, kann sie jedes dort gespeicherte Passwort lesen."

#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:438
msgid "The app wants media controls"
msgstr "Die App möchte die Mediensteuerung"

#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:438
msgid "Allow media keys and keeping the screen awake."
msgstr "Medientasten erlauben und den Bildschirm eingeschaltet lassen."

#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:446
msgid "The app asked for a dangerous service"
msgstr "Die App wollte einen gefährlichen Dienst"

#. Keep the {placeholders}; their order may change.
#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:449
msgid ""
"The app tried to use {why}. SAM does not offer this: it would let the app "
"escape the sandbox."
msgstr ""
"Die App wollte {why} nutzen. SAM bietet das nicht an: Damit könnte die App "
"aus der Sandbox ausbrechen."

#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:454
msgid "A desktop service is blocked"
msgstr "Ein Desktop-Dienst ist gesperrt"

#. Keep the {placeholders}; their order may change.
#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:457
msgid ""
"The app tried to use {name}, which the D-Bus filter blocks. Allow just this "
"service."
msgstr ""
"Die App wollte {name} nutzen, das der D-Bus-Filter sperrt. Erlaube nur "
"diesen Dienst."

#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:482
msgid "Sound is off"
msgstr "Ton ist aus"

#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:482
msgid "The app tried to use audio. Turn on sound."
msgstr "Die App wollte Ton nutzen. Schalte Ton ein."

#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:497
msgid "The app wants PipeWire directly"
msgstr "Die App möchte PipeWire direkt"

#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:497
msgid ""
"It has sound through PulseAudio, but tried to connect to PipeWire itself. "
"Direct access also reaches cameras and other apps' screen streams; allow it "
"only if sound does not work otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Sie hat Ton über PulseAudio, wollte sich aber selbst mit PipeWire verbinden. "
"Direkter Zugriff erreicht auch Kameras und Bildschirmübertragungen anderer "
"Apps; erlaube ihn nur, wenn Ton sonst nicht geht."

#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:500
msgid "The app starts another AppImage"
msgstr "Die App startet ein anderes AppImage"

#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:500
msgid ""
"It tried to mount an AppImage with FUSE, which is not available in a "
"sandbox. SAM already asks AppImages to unpack themselves instead; if this "
"still fails, the inner app needs its own sandbox."
msgstr ""
"Sie wollte ein AppImage mit FUSE einhängen, das in einer Sandbox nicht "
"verfügbar ist. SAM bittet AppImages bereits, sich stattdessen selbst zu "
"entpacken; wenn das trotzdem scheitert, braucht die innere App ihre eigene "
"Sandbox."

#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:507
msgid "The app crashed"
msgstr "Die App ist abgestürzt"

#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:507
msgid ""
"A crash right at start is often a missing system file. Showing all of /usr "
"is the safest first step."
msgstr ""
"Ein Absturz gleich beim Start liegt oft an einer fehlenden Systemdatei. "
"Ganz /usr zu zeigen ist der sicherste erste Schritt."

#. Keep the {placeholders}; their order may change.
#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:617
msgid "Turns off “{setting}”. {explanation}"
msgstr "Schaltet „{setting}“ aus. {explanation}"

#. Keep the {placeholders}; their order may change.
#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:619
msgid "Turns on “{setting}”. {explanation}"
msgstr "Schaltet „{setting}“ ein. {explanation}"

#. Keep the {placeholders}; their order may change.
#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:624
msgid "Adds {value} to “{setting}”. {explanation}"
msgstr "Fügt {value} zu „{setting}“ hinzu. {explanation}"

#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:629
msgid "Compatibility mode changes nothing more for these settings."
msgstr "Der Kompatibilitätsmodus ändert bei diesen Einstellungen nichts mehr."

#. Keep the {placeholders}; their order may change.
#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:631
msgid ""
"Turns on: {settings}. Each of these weakens the sandbox; once the app works, "
"try turning them off one by one."
msgstr ""
"Schaltet ein: {settings}. Jedes davon schwächt die Sandbox; sobald die App "
"funktioniert, schalte sie nacheinander probeweise wieder aus."

#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:638
msgid ""
"Starts the app with --no-sandbox, which turns off the app's own internal "
"sandbox; SAM's sandbox stays."
msgstr ""
"Startet die App mit --no-sandbox, das die eigene interne Sandbox der App "
"abschaltet; SAMs Sandbox bleibt."

#. Keep the {placeholders}; their order may change.
#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:640
msgid "Starts the app with {value} every time."
msgstr "Startet die App jedes Mal mit {value}."

#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:657
msgid ""
"Grants broad access: the network, all of /usr, X11, GPU, sound and the full "
"session bus. Through the full session bus the app can ask desktop services "
"to run programs outside its sandbox, so this is a way out. Only when nothing "
"else helps, and only for apps you trust."
msgstr ""
"Gibt weiten Zugriff: das Netzwerk, ganz /usr, X11, GPU, Ton und den ganzen "
"Sitzungsbus. Über den ganzen Sitzungsbus kann die App Desktop-Dienste "
"bitten, Programme außerhalb ihrer Sandbox zu starten, das ist also ein Weg "
"nach draußen. Nur wenn nichts anderes hilft, und nur für Apps, denen du "
"vertraust."

#: crates/sam-runner/src/repair.rs:673
