#~ msgid ""
#~ "Gamepads and joysticks that are plugged in when the app starts. Keyboards "
#~ "and mice stay hidden."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Gamepads und Joysticks, die beim Start der App angeschlossen sind. "
#~ "Tastaturen und Mäuse bleiben verborgen."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "{path} is in a folder the app can change, so the app could swap it for "
#~ "another socket during the start; it is not passed into the sandbox. Keep "
#~ "the socket in a folder the app cannot write."
